Started this game last night, playing a wizard.  Looked at my stats;
hmmm, not bad for a wizard.  Even better after that blessed potion
of gain ability I started with!  Other starting equipment?  Ring of
regeneration (this is one of the BEST items there are - it got this
character through more than a few scrapes).  Magic marker, wand of
cancellation, ring of stealth, enchant weapon scroll, other stuff I
can't remember.

Found an axe called Cleaver, just lying around, on level 2.  Ran
across a huge general store with a lot of good stuff.  Excalibur
from a bones level (about level 4) plus a lot of other goodies.
Strength is up to 18/02 thanks to a tin of spinach and a stone giant.
Heaps of zorkmids from a zoo; also cleaned out a throne room (no
wishes, but the throne gave me a genocide (liches) and increased my
hp by about 8 points).  Got the intrinsics of telepathy, poison res,
fire res very easily.

Currently on level 9, with a few goodies including a pickaxe,
expensive camera, jumping boots, 2 unicorn horns, Hawaiian shirt
(+1 so far), wands of teleport and digging.  Waiting for a
stupid death to happen :-)

One thing puzzles me: at one stage, my maximum hp dropped from
55 to 50, and stayed at 50 until I went up a level.  I also
noticed later that some memorised spells were gone.  It's not
the first time this has happened to me.  What causes this?

